WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,360
kick them out

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,760
Ignore these idiots

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,160
Who is it?

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,920
She is the manager of the remaining bases

5
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,760
The remaining leader of the alliance

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,360
The boss of us all

7
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,560
Han Qingxia

8
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,530
Han Qingxia, are you here?

9
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:17,930
Everyone is waiting for your meeting

10
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,370
Little girl, I didn’t say anything without you

11
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,970
We don't dare to move. Wait.

12
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:23,110
What else do you want to do

13
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:24,510
I just heard

14
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,230
Your base is out of supplies.

15
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,410
I want to help you

16
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:30,490
We can't feed so many people without supplies.

17
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,810
Please keep these bodyguards under your command.

18
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,410
I gave them a bowl of rice to eat

19
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,090
follow me

20
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,920
I can eat meat in the future

21
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:43,730
I'll stay, I'll stay too

22
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,490
Wan'an base is not a base at all

23
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:47,050
It is the Qin family’s own emperor’s family
